missions to be automatically sent to your Mailchimp account.'=>'Integra o Gravity Forms com o Mailchimp, permitindo que as submissões de formulários sejam automaticamente enviadas para a sua conta no Mailchimp.','https://gravityforms.com'=>'https://gravityforms.com','Gravity Forms Mailchimp Add-On'=>'Gravity Forms Mailchimp Add-On']];